1TCDfnlpuElweRNeFTPvdrSPs87IFyeIthGxJnQW6r62KdGNQY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDlWr98Ti9vxLkDnxmuxZNQYuu_DlEZw2wSb4-erv7-CA&oe=6A4FB663"}, "display_name": "Star Phoenix Reincarnation Galaxy Games", "keywords": ["dogfight", "phoenix", "bullethell", "invincible", "space"], "long_description": "Who am I?\nWhen I woke up, a mysterious voice spoke to me...\n\n\"You, use the power of the Phoenix Clan.\"\n\nAnyway, it seems that the only way I can survive is to board the high-speed spaceship in front of me and annihilate the approaching spacenoids...\n\n[How to play]\nUse the central controller to control your fighter plane.\n\nHigh performance laser with auto-aiming and auto-tracking!\nThe best of three types, Straight, Wide, and Strong, is automatically selected depending on the enemy situation.\nIf you destroy enemy planes in succession, you will achieve a combo and get extra points.\nWhen you are not operating the game, a strengthened barrier will be activated and you will be invincible.\n\nDefeat enemies and absorb energy balls to level up.\nLevel up and strengthen your character by selecting Phoenix, Bullet, Laser, or Battery.\nTouch the Phoenix that appears in the top right corner of the Level Up Select to perform an invincible attack for a certain period of time.\nTouch the Bullet that appears in the top right corner of the Level Up Select to perform a bullet barrage attack.\n\nEnergy bonuses will appear every time you reach a certain level.\nAbsorb energy to get points.\nGuide the bullets well, stick them together to make them bigger and get a high score.\n\nYour fighter plane will not take damage even if it collides with an enemy.\nIt will take damage if its altitude drops below 0m.\n\nCopyright 2024- Nam Creations", "short_description": "Hack and slash, Vampire Survivors like, omnidirectional dogfight shooter\n\n[Features]\n\u25cf Phoenix reincarnation - Experience unrivaled and invincible with powerful barrage attacks\n\u25cf Annihilate enemies with high-performance lasers that auto-target and auto-track\n\u25cf Strengthen your ship with Vampire Survivors like system\n\u25cf Intuitive controls that work just as you want for maximum exhilaration"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://namcreations.cloudfree.jp/StarPhoenix_Meta.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Nam Creations", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.facebook.com/share/1VavtPiL5F/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "9538395929593642"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "587509247629813"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "587509247629813"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1755299460, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "587509247629813"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "9743624505737449", "version": "1.3"}, "id": "626600493787835", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "9518654878234414", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "9743624505